@startuml Iteration4_TimingDiagram

title Iteration 4 - Timing Diagram: Fault Detection & Handling

scale 1 as 50 pixels

concise "Drone 1" as D1
concise "Drone 2" as D2

@0
D1 is IDLE
D2 is IDLE

@1
D1 is EN_ROUTE
D2 is EN_ROUTE

@3
D1 is DROPPING

@4
D2 is FAULT_STUCK

@5=
D1 is IDLE

@6
D1 is EN_ROUTE
D2 is RETURNING

@8
D1 is DROPPING
D2 is IDLE

@9
D1 is FAULT_NOZZLE

@10
D1 is OFFLINE
D2 is EN_ROUTE

@12
D2 is DROPPING

@13
D2 is IDLE

highlight 4 to 6 #FFECB3;line:FFA000 : Soft Fault
highlight 9 to 13 #FFCDD2;line:D32F2F : Hard Fault

@enduml
